; coh-min's runtime library. Stdlib-only (no yojson/menhir/ppx/unix); every
; dependency is in-tree. It shares NO code with the frozen `coh` engine
; (src/engine/ocaml) or the Ascent-0 project; it VENDORS `json.ml` and
; `sha256.ml` verbatim from `../ascent-0/lib/` and is otherwise its own.
;
; Module order is the pipeline order, and it is a dependency order too — each
; module depends only on the ones above it, so the layering is checkable by
; reading this list:
;
;   sha256 json      vendored, byte-identical to ascent-0
;   value            the closed scalar domain of a run fact
;   jread            total, result-returning JSON accessors
;   rule             the CM-owned result algebra, and its generic evaluator
;   ir               tsc-cm-ir/0.2 — what the methodology REQUIRES
;   provider         capability contracts and the mechanical providers
;   request          tsc-run-request/0.1 and the subject snapshot scheme
;   plan             tsc-sandbox-plan/0.1 — what the linker GRANTED
;   linker           selection + the discharge obligations
;   exec             the checker DAG scheduler
;   receipt          tsc-measurement-receipt/0.2
;   runner           the pipeline, and the artifact-family table
(library
 (name coh_min)
 (modules sha256 json value jread rule ir provider request plan linker exec
          receipt runner))
